OL,3,AHolocaust school lessons to be improved
OL,4,Aafter 'shocking' antisemitism review
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell says
OL,7,Fthe government will "update and
OL,8,Fstrengthen" Holocaust education within
OL,9,Fschools after a major review
OL,10,Fhighlighted the "shocking scale" of
OL,11,Fantisemitism in British society.
OL,13,FSchools and colleges in England will be
OL,14,Frequired to recognise antisemitism as a
OL,15,Fdistinct category of harm and take
OL,16,Fexplicit action against it.
OL,18,FIt means anti-Jewish hatred will be
OL,19,Ftreated as a specific safeguarding risk
OL,20,Frather than being dealt with through
OL,21,Fexisting measures to stop racism and
OL,22,Fbullying.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
