OL,3,AHolocaust school lessons to be improved
OL,4,Aafter 'shocking' antisemitism review
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has accepted all of the
OL,7,F27 recommendations made in the
OL,8,Fgovernment-commissioned review
OL,9,Fincluding dedicated training for
OL,10,Fteachers and more consistent recording
OL,11,Fof incidents.
